    "detailed_description": "Zombies that fell asleep deep in the ground have been awakened by a curse.<br />\r\nThe main character who is trapped in the midst of the curse endlessly hunts zombies.<br />\r\nThe battle never ends... So how long can you endure...?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&gt; Jeonju Hanok Village, an actual tourist attraction in S. Korea, is implemented in the game as a digital twin.<br />\r\n&gt; This is a zombie shooting game.<br />\r\n&gt; Use a variety of firearms to hunt zombies and clear missions.<br />\r\n&gt; Collect gold and use them to strengthen your weapons and collect souls to upgrade your abilities.",
